+### Experimental Ascend Laser input layout
+
+For the packed-prefix BF16 path with `MINDIE_SD_FA_TYPE=ascend_laser_attention`,
+`--additional-config '{"npu_laser_fp16_layout":true}'` requests a contiguous
+head-first FP16 cast before calling the public MindIE attention API. This
+combines dtype conversion with layout materialization while preserving the
+FP16 input and BF16 output conversion boundaries of MindIE-SD 3.1 Laser.
+Model-provided input scaling and valid-prefix slicing remain in effect.
+
+The option defaults to false. It is intended for the legacy FP16 Laser path;
+it does not preserve the arithmetic of newer native-BF16 Laser implementations.
+Synthetic operator parity is insufficient to establish model quality or
+end-to-end speedup. Validate the installed MindIE version and actual workload
+before enabling it.
+
